   "text": "# App repo: owned by the app team. Deployment config (Helm chart, environments, ArgoCD) is NOT here,\n# it lives in the GitOps repo (github.com/rosaliei/gitops-monorepo), owned by the devops team.\n*                     @rosaliei",
